  "title": "Fresh Corn and Tomato Casserole",
  "description": "This casserole is wonderful for a backyard picnic. It uses all fresh ingredients and simply contains corn, tomatoes and bacon. A great complement for a barbecue.",
  "authors": [
    "Ronda Miller"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-06-08T13:23:35-04:00",
